                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [f,Set] : [\mathcal{C}(A), Set] \to [\mathcal{C}(B), Set]
              for this. Notice that by the equivalence of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/copresheaves"} copresheaves
              on
