              on the corresponding
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexandroff+locales"} Alexandroff locales
              (see there for details) this is equivalently
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
