              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  Proceedings of
                  %a{:href => "http://qpl.science.ru.nl/"} QPL 2011
              %a{:href => "http://rvg.web.cse.unsw.edu.au/eptcs/content.cgi?QPL2011"} EPTCS 95, 2012
              (2012) 211-218 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1109.1397"}> arXiv:1109.1397
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://dx.doi.org/10.4204/EPTCS.95.15"} doi:10.4204/EPTCS.95.15
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li#Landsman17
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Klaas+Landsman"}> Klaas Landsman
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Topos theory and quantum logic
              = succeed "," do
                %em Foundations of quantum theory – From classical concepts to Operator algebras
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-319-51777-3"} doi:10.1007/978-3-319-51777-3
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007%2F978-3-319-51777-3.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The original suggestion to interpret the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kochen-Specker+theorem"} Kochen-Specker theorem
            in the topos over the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/poset+of+commutative+subalgebras"} poset of commutative subalgebras
            (there taken to be
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/presheaves"} presheaves
            instead of
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/copresheaves"} copresheaves
          %ul
            %li#ButterfieldHamiltonIsham
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jeremy+Butterfield"}> Jeremy Butterfield
                , John Hamilton,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Isham"} Chris Isham
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A topos perspective on the Kochen-Specker theorem
                = succeed "," do
                  %em I. quantum states as generalized valuations
                %strong 37
                11 (1998) 2669-2733 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1023/A:1026680806775"}> doi:10.1023/A:1026680806775
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/9803055"} arXiv:quant-ph/9803055
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1669557"} MR2000c:81027
              %p
                %em II. conceptual aspects and classical analogues
                Int. J. of Theor. Phys.
                %strong 38
                3 (1999) 827-859 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1697983"}> MR2000f:81012
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1023/A:1026652817988"} doi:10.1023/A:1026652817988
              %p
                %em> III. Von Neumann algebras as the base category
